<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 4.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - AUG 4.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Prime Minister Mart Siimann will discuss the party's internal disagreements with former prime minister and Coalition Party leader, Tiit Vaehi.</p>
<p>- Russian President Boris Yeltsin, said a revaluation of the ruble would not affect ordinary people.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
